Technical Notes

- Fully consistent with PTYPE-based particle pipeline (DM or disk proxy).
- Sérsic fitting performed in log-space for numerical stability.
- Q(R,t) computation uses flat rotation curve approximation for κ.
- SF thresholds are phenomenological, calibrated for DM proxy behavior.
- Handles missing snapshots and low-particle-count bins robustly.

